OL,3,GNEWSAFire service moved after asbestos
OL,4,Afound in station
OL,5,
OL,6,FFire crews at Alderney Airport have
OL,7,Fbeen moved to a new building due to
OL,8,Fdust and debris containing asbestos
OL,9,Fbeing discovered in their station.
OL,11,FSamples of the debris found in one of
OL,12,Fthe vehicle bays on 24 September were
OL,13,Fsent away for testing, with the results
OL,14,Fon 5 October finding it contained
OL,15,Fasbestos.
OL,17,FGuernsey Ports said the move to Ayline
OL,18,FHouse - also on the airport's grounds -
OL,19,Fwas a "precautionary measure" taken
OL,20,Fafter the testing detected asbestos and
OL,21,Ffurther investigations were being
OL,22,Fcarried out.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
