OL,3,GNEWSAFire service moved after asbestos
OL,4,Afound in station
OL,5,
OL,6,FPorts said crews would operate from
OL,7,Falternative accommodation while the
OL,8,Fstation building was made safe and the
OL,9,Fairport would continue to operate as
OL,10,Fnormal.
